{
  "format": "ai-mobile-preset",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "preset-image",
  "category": "image",
  "worldInfoEnabled": false,
  "name": "生图 · NovelAI tags",
  "defaultFor": [
    "image"
  ],
  "description": "把要画的画面写成 NovelAI V4.5 的英文 tags；外观 tags 由「出图 · 最终提示词」那块加在最前面。\"画什么\"四块按这次画的类型只发一块。 发给模型的每一句、出图加的每个词都在下面的块里，能改能删。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "identifier": "main",
      "name": "任务",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你是 NovelAI V4.5 的提示词写手，把一个画面写成 Danbooru 风格的英文 tags。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "rules",
      "name": "规则",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "规则：\n- tags 顺序：人数（1girl / 1boy / 1girl, 1boy）→ 构图与镜头（upper body, cowboy shot, from side, close-up…）→ 表情与动作 → 服装 → 场景与背景 → 光线、天气、时段 → 氛围。\n- 不要写角色的外观（发色、瞳色、发型、体型），「出图 · 最终提示词」那块会加在最前面。\n- 不要写画师名和质量词（masterpiece、best quality 之类）。\n- 画幅：人物特写、半身是竖图（不用写 size###）；风景、两个人并排写 size###landscape###。\n- 画面里有两个以上的人时，image### 里用 | 隔开：第一段写整体画面（总人数如 2girls、1boy, 1girl，构图、场景、光线），后面每段写一个人（girl / boy / other 不带数字、长相、表情、动作、服装），每个人的特征就不会串；两个人之间的动作用 source# / target# / mutual# 写在各自那一段（例如 source#hug、target#hug，相互的两边都写 mutual#hug）；只针对某个人的负面 tags 在 negative### 里按同样的顺序用 | 隔开（第一段是整体的）。{{char}}在画面里时，{{char}}那一段只写人物类别、表情、动作、服装（长相「出图 · 最终提示词」那块会加在最前面）。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "outfitFree",
      "name": "服装参考关着（AI 自己设计衣服）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "服装参考关着（生图设置里关了\"服装参考\"）：这次不参考{{char}}设定里的衣服、今天穿的那套，也不参考{{user}}常穿的那套，衣服由你按这一刻自己设计。\n- 按地点、在做什么、季节和天气、时段、氛围给出合适的穿搭，写成具体的服装 tags：上衣、下装或连衣裙、外套、鞋、配饰，颜色、材质和款式写清楚（例如 white blouse, pleated skirt, beige cardigan, loafers）。\n- \"要画的画面\"里写了穿什么（泳装、浴衣、睡衣……）就照它画。\n- 单人图把衣服写进 image###；两个人同框时两个人的衣服都写进 image###（用 | 分人时写进各自那一段），两个人的穿搭可以互相搭配。\n- 只写衣服，不写长相（长相「出图 · 最终提示词」那块会加）。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "outfit-free"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "modeScene",
      "name": "画什么 · 场景",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "画什么：画面就是下面\"要画的画面\"描述的那一刻。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "scene"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "modePortrait",
      "name": "画什么 · 全身像",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "画什么：画{{char}}的全身像（full body）：站姿或坐姿、服装、表情；背景简单。tags 以 \"full body\" 开头。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "portrait"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "modeFace",
      "name": "画什么 · 脸部特写",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "画什么：画{{char}}的脸部特写（close-up / portrait，像自拍）：表情、发型和发饰、上半身的衣服；不要画脖子以下。tags 以 \"close-up, portrait\" 开头。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "face"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "modeBackground",
      "name": "画什么 · 只画背景",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "画什么：只画场景，不画任何人物：地点、时段、天气、光线和细节。tags 以 \"no humans, scenery\" 开头，不要写人数、表情、服装。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "format",
      "name": "输出格式（### 和它前面的英文词别改）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "只输出下面这样的一段，不要任何其他文字（### 和它前面的英文词别改，程序按它读）：\nimage###逗号分隔的英文 tags###\n需要额外的负面 tags 时另起一行写 negative###英文 tags###；不是竖图时另起一行写 size###landscape### 或 size###square###（程序给了\"画幅\"时照程序的）。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSubject",
      "name": "角色和外观 tags",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "角色：{{char}}（{{pronoun}}）；外观 tags（出图时「最终提示词」那块会加上，不要重复）：{{char_appearance}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageOutfit",
      "name": "今天穿什么（衣服没锁时）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{char}}今天穿：{{char_outfit}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "outfit-unlocked"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageOutfitLocked",
      "name": "锁定的衣服（衣服锁定时）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "服装：{{char_outfit_name}}；服装 tags（出图时「最终提示词」那块会加在外观后面，不要重复，也不要另写别的衣服）：{{char_outfit_tags}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "outfit-locked"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageScene",
      "name": "地点",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "地点：{{image_place}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_place"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageTime",
      "name": "时段",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "时段：{{image_time}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageWeather",
      "name": "天气",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "天气：{{image_weather}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_weather"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageExpression",
      "name": "此刻的表情",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "此刻的表情：{{image_expression}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_expression"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSizeLine",
      "name": "画幅（场景定了画幅时）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "画幅：{{image_size}}（portrait 竖图 / landscape 横图 / square 方图），出图按这个画幅，构图照它来",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_size"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageRecent",
      "name": "最近的对话",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "最近的对话：\n{{image_recent::6}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_recent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageCaption",
      "name": "要画的画面",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{image_caption}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "has:image_caption"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capAutoScene",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 没写描述（场景）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：按最近的聊天，画此刻的画面",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "auto-caption+scene"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capAutoPortrait",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 没写描述（全身像）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{char}}此刻的全身像",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "auto-caption+portrait"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capAutoFace",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 没写描述（脸部特写）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{char}}此刻的脸部特写",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "auto-caption+face"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capAutoBackground",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 没写描述（只画背景）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{image_place}}，{{char}}此刻所在的地方",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "auto-caption+background+has:image_place"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capAutoBackgroundNoPlace",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 没写描述（只画背景，不知道在哪）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{char}}此刻所在的地方",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "auto-caption+background+no:image_place"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capCharacterPortrait",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 角色页试画全身像",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "要画的画面：{{char}}的全身像：白色背景，站着看向镜头，表情自然",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "character-portrait"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capCharacterFandom",
      "name": "要画的画面 · 角色页试画全身像（同人角色）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "看看画出来是不是原作里的样子",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "character-portrait+fandom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capDiary",
      "name": "日记的配图 · 日记正文",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{char}}的日记：{{diary_text}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "diary+has:diary_text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "capMoments",
      "name": "朋友圈的配图 · 朋友圈正文",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{{char}}的朋友圈：{{moments_text}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "moments+has:moments_text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageFinal",
      "name": "出图 · 最终提示词（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{image_count}}, {{char_look}}, {{char_outfit_locked}}, {{image_tags}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-prompt:scene",
        "image-prompt:portrait",
        "image-prompt:face"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageFinalNoHumans",
      "name": "出图 · 最终提示词 · image### 写了 no humans 时（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{image}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-prompt:no-humans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageFinalBackground",
      "name": "出图 · 最终提示词 · 只画背景（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "no humans, scenery, {{image}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-prompt:background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageNegative",
      "name": "出图 · 最终负面词（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "{{char_negative}}, {{negative}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-negative:scene",
        "image-negative:portrait",
        "image-negative:face",
        "image-negative:no-humans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageNegativeBackground",
      "name": "出图 · 最终负面词 · 只画背景（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "1girl, 1boy, people, {{negative}}",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-negative:background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSizeDefault",
      "name": "出图 · 场景和模型都没定画幅时用（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "portrait",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-size:scene",
        "image-size:portrait",
        "image-size:face",
        "image-size:no-humans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageSizeBackground",
      "name": "出图 · 只画背景、没定画幅时用（不发给模型）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "landscape",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "image-size:background"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageRetry",
      "name": "格式不对时让模型重写（只在重写时发）",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "上面的输出没有按要求的写法。请只输出 image###逗号分隔的英文 tags### 这样的一段（需要时另起一行 negative###…###），不要 JSON、不要任何其他文字。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "retry"
      ]
    },
    {
      "identifier": "imageVibe",
      "name": "带上你立绘的 Vibe（不发给模型；人设里开着 Vibe 才有）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "触发条件对上这一次的类型时，出图带上你人设立绘的 Vibe。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "triggers": [
        "vibe:duo"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sampler": {
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "topP": 1,
    "maxTokens": 800,
    "contextTokens": 32000,
    "frequencyPenalty": 0,
    "presencePenalty": 0,
    "stream": false
  },
  "formats": {
    "newChatPrompt": "",
    "newExampleChatPrompt": "",
    "continueNudgePrompt": "",
    "impersonationPrompt": "",
    "sendIfEmpty": "",
    "wiFormat": "{0}",
    "scenarioFormat": "{{scenario}}",
    "personalityFormat": "{{personality}}",
    "namesBehavior": 0,
    "squashSystemMessages": false,
    "preferCharacterPrompt": true,
    "preferCharacterJailbreak": true
  },
  "regex": []
}
